{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_8_level_main_08-15_end","groupId":"main_8","stageId":"main_08-15","title":"恨火，流向原野","storyCode":"JT8-1","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_08-15_end.txt","sourceHash":"f19219765784e136c19190329b4563718a9947e2584975d51721d1572139a497","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"當恨意無法抑制，當惡行洶湧肆虐，自詡正義的勇士不得不面對淒厲的真相。她融化在自己背負的陰影中，事實吞噬了她的意志。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snowconutry_3"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏薩斯農民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏薩斯農民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"火！火！燙啊啊啊！！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏薩斯農民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"救命！！！！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_8_11"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"爸爸！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哨兵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼回事！快走，快跑啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"兒子，我的兒子！你這畜生......感染的牲口！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊！！火太大了，火太大了！咳，咳，唔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"混蛋！！！我死也不會......我詛咒你！！我詛咒你！！！皇帝在上，懲罰這些該死的感染者吧！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊......啊......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"narration","text":"已經不能再回頭了。\n至此，這裡發生的事，除了塔露拉外，無人知曉。\n之後的事情，眾所皆知。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_top"},{"type":"narration","text":"阿米婭睜開眼睛。\n她的眼淚還沒乾。但她已經看過了一切。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼這裡會有隻卡特斯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭！！當心！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_010_chen","aliases":["陳"]},{"speakerId":"char_011_talula","aliases":["塔露拉"]}]}
